# The build root is <repo>/build/native, and the repo root already ignores
# [Bb]in/ and [Oo]bj/, which covers the C# projects here. What is left are the
# native object trees and the staged copies of the engine binary that
# build-windows.ps1 / build-unix.sh drop next to the output.

CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
DartConfiguration.tcl
Testing/

# Native build artifacts, wherever a build is pointed.
*.obj
*.exp
*.pdb
*.ilk
libandzip_core.so*
libandzip_core.dylib

# Engine binaries staged for the C# shell. These are produced by a build; they
# are not sources, and the C# projects build fine without them.
csharp/Andzip.Native/runtimes/
csharp/Andzip.Native.Tests/runtimes/

# scripts/vendor-sources.ps1 scratch area when it is not pointed elsewhere.
third_party/.vendor-tmp/
